@*
    ── קטלוג פרויקטים (Admin Project Catalog) ───────────────────────────────
    Route:  /management/catalog  — reached from the ניהול hub
            (LecturerManagementPage / ManagementCardsGrid → "קטלוג פרויקטים").

    Visual source:
        Client/Pages/Management/Users/UsersManagement.razor — the finished
        Admin table screen. This page is deliberately its sibling: the same
        header shape (title + counted summary / actions), the same one-row
        toolbar of search and "name: value" filter pills, the same MDataTable,
        the same tag / dot-and-text / kebab cell vocabulary, the same modal
        language. Nothing new was invented for this screen.

    WHAT CHANGED, AND WHAT DID NOT
    ──────────────────────────────
    CHANGED: the presentation only. The topbar-with-a-back-arrow, the KPI card
    row, the inline add panel, the sliding detail sheet and the bespoke .cat-*
    table are gone — none of them exist on the finished Admin screen, and the
    canvas shell already provides the nav this page's back arrow duplicated.

    NOT CHANGED: every data path. The list is still ICatalogService.GetCatalogAsync
    → GET api/catalog. Create and edit are still CreateProjectWithErrorAsync /
    UpdateProjectWithErrorAsync, with the same four validations, the same
    SaveCatalogProjectRequest and the same field set. Availability still flips
    through ToggleAvailabilityAsync. The Airtable route still goes to the
    preview→confirm surface and never straight to the import endpoint.

    WHERE THE REAL MODEL DIFFERS FROM THE USERS SCREEN
    ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
    • STATUS. The old filter offered exactly זמין / לא זמין, but Projects.Status
      also carries values written by the assignment flow ("Active",
      "InProgress"), and rows holding them were unreachable through that filter.
      The options are now DERIVED from the loaded set — the same construction
      UsersManagement uses for its cycle filter — so every row is reachable.
    • MENTOR. There is no mentor column on the catalog record; mentors are
      assigned on the Active Projects screen (see the note at the foot of
      this comment). The column is absent rather than faked.
    • SORTING AND PAGING are client-side over the one unpaged GET, because that
      is what the endpoint returns and no paging contract exists to change.
      117 seeded projects is past the point where one unbroken list is
      readable, which is why this screen has a pager and the 28-row users
      screen does not.
*@

@page "/management/catalog"
@layout AppLayout
@attribute [Authorize(Roles = Roles.Admin + "," + Roles.Staff)]
@using AuthWithAdmin.Client.Services
@inject NavigationManager Nav
@inject ICatalogService CatalogService

@* ══════════════════════════════════════════
     ADD / EDIT PROPOSAL MODAL
     One modal for both, exactly as the one form did before — _editingId is
     still what tells them apart, and every field, placeholder, maxlength and
     validation below is the one that was there.
     ══════════════════════════════════════════ *@
@if (_showForm)
{
    <div class="pc-modal-overlay" @onclick="CancelForm">
        <div class="pc-modal-box pc-modal-box--wide" @onclick:stopPropagation="true">
            <div class="pc-modal-header">
                <div>
                    <div class="pc-modal-title">@(_editingId == 0 ? "הוספת פרויקט" : "עריכת פרויקט")</div>
                    <div class="pc-modal-subtitle">
                        @(_editingId == 0 ? "הפרויקט ייווצר ללא שיוך צוות" : _formTitle)
                    </div>
                </div>
                <button type="button" class="pc-modal-close" @onclick="CancelForm" title="סגירה" aria-label="סגירה">
                    <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                         stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12" />
                    </svg>
                </button>
            </div>

            <div class="pc-modal-body">

                @* ── מידע בסיסי ──────────────────────────────── *@
                <div class="pc-form-section">
                    <div class="pc-form-section-title">מידע בסיסי</div>

                    <div class="pc-form-row">
                        <div class="pc-form-field">
                            <label class="pc-form-label">מספר פרויקט *</label>
                            <input class="pc-form-input" type="number" @bind="_formNumber" min="1" placeholder="101" />
                        </div>
                        <div class="pc-form-field">
                            <label class="pc-form-label">סוג פרויקט *</label>
                            <MSelectField Options="@FormTypeOptions"
                                          Value="@_formTypeId.ToString()"
                                          ValueChanged="@(v => _formTypeId = int.TryParse(v, out var n) ? n : 0)"
                                          AriaLabel="סוג פרויקט"
                                          Class="pc-form-select" />
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="pc-form-field">
                        <label class="pc-form-label">שם / נושא הפרויקט *</label>
                        <input class="pc-form-input" @bind="_formTitle" maxlength="200" placeholder="הזן שם הפרויקט…" />
                    </div>

                    <div class="pc-form-row">
                        <div class="pc-form-field">
                            <label class="pc-form-label">מחזור אקדמי *</label>
                            <MSelectField Options="@FormYearOptions"
                                          Value="@_formYearId.ToString()"
                                          ValueChanged="@(v => _formYearId = int.TryParse(v, out var n) ? n : 0)"
                                          AriaLabel="מחזור אקדמי"
                                          Class="pc-form-select" />
                        </div>
                        <div class="pc-form-field">
                            <label class="pc-form-label">עדיפות</label>
                            <MSelectField Options="@_priorityOptions"
                                          @bind-Value="_formPriority"
                                          AriaLabel="עדיפות"
                                          Class="pc-form-select" />
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="pc-form-field">
                        <label class="pc-form-label">תיאור / צורך</label>
                        <textarea class="pc-form-textarea" @bind="_formDescription" rows="3" maxlength="1000"
                                  placeholder="תיאור קצר של הצורך / הבעיה שהפרויקט עונה עליה…"></textarea>
                    </div>
                </div>

                @* ── ארגון ויצירת קשר ────────────────────────── *@
                <div class="pc-form-section">
                    <div class="pc-form-section-title">
                        ארגון ויצירת קשר
                        <span class="pc-form-section-optional">אופציונלי</span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="pc-form-row">
                        <div class="pc-form-field">
                            <label class="pc-form-label">שם ארגון</label>
                            <input class="pc-form-input" @bind="_formOrgName" maxlength="200" placeholder="לדוגמה: עיריית תל אביב" />
                        </div>
                        <div class="pc-form-field">
                            <label class="pc-form-label">קהל יעד</label>
                            <input class="pc-form-input" @bind="_formTargetAudience" maxlength="200" placeholder="לדוגמה: תלמידי תיכון" />
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="pc-form-row">
                        <div class="pc-form-field">
                            <label class="pc-form-label">איש קשר</label>
                            <input class="pc-form-input" @bind="_formContactPerson" maxlength="150" placeholder="שם מלא" />
                        </div>
                        <div class="pc-form-field">
                            <label class="pc-form-label">תפקיד איש קשר</label>
                            <input class="pc-form-input" @bind="_formContactRole" maxlength="150" placeholder="לדוגמה: מנהל פרויקטים" />
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="pc-form-field">
                        <label class="pc-form-label">מטרות הפרויקט</label>
                        <textarea class="pc-form-textarea" @bind="_formGoals" rows="2" maxlength="1000"
                                  placeholder="תאר את המטרות העיקריות של הפרויקט…"></textarea>
                    </div>
                </div>

                @* ── הגדרות פנימיות ──────────────────────────── *@
                <div class="pc-form-section">
                    <div class="pc-form-section-title">
                        הגדרות פנימיות
                        <span class="pc-form-section-optional">אופציונלי</span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="pc-form-row">
                        <div class="pc-form-field">
                            <label class="pc-form-label">מקור הרשומה</label>
                            <MSelectField Options="@_sourceTypeOptions"
                                          @bind-Value="_formSourceType"
                                          AriaLabel="מקור הרשומה"
                                          Class="pc-form-select" />
                        </div>
                        <div class="pc-form-field">
                            <label class="pc-form-label">זמינות לשיוך</label>
                            <MSelectField Options="@_formStatusOptions"
                                          @bind-Value="_formStatus"
                                          AriaLabel="זמינות לשיוך"
                                          Class="pc-form-select" />
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="pc-form-field">
                        <label class="pc-form-label">הערות פנימיות</label>
                        <textarea class="pc-form-textarea" @bind="_formInternalNotes" rows="2" maxlength="2000"
                                  placeholder="הערות שמיועדות לצוות הניהול בלבד…"></textarea>
                    </div>
                </div>

                @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(_formError))
                {
                    <div class="pc-form-error">@_formError</div>
                }
            </div>

            <div class="pc-modal-footer">
                <button type="button" class="pc-btn-ghost" @onclick="CancelForm" disabled="@_formSaving">ביטול</button>
                <button type="button" class="pc-btn-primary motiva-cta" @onclick="SubmitForm" disabled="@_formSaving">
                    @if (_formSaving)
                    {
                        <span class="pc-spinner-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    }
                    @(_editingId == 0 ? "הוספה" : "שמירה")
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
}

@* ══════════════════════════════════════════
     PROPOSAL DETAIL — read-only
     Same sections and the same conditional blocks the sliding panel had; it
     is a modal now so the page has one overlay language, not two.
     ══════════════════════════════════════════ *@
@if (_detailProject is not null)
{
    <div class="pc-modal-overlay" @onclick="CloseDetail">
        <div class="pc-modal-box pc-modal-box--wide" @onclick:stopPropagation="true">
            <div class="pc-modal-header">
                <div class="pc-modal-head-id">
                    <div>
                        @* No column header names it here, so it keeps its "#".
                           Above the title, as a reference line — the same
                           secondary treatment the table cell now uses. *@
                        <span class="pc-num pc-num--lg" aria-label="@($"מספר פרויקט {_detailProject.ProjectNumber}")">
                            #@_detailProject.ProjectNumber
                        </span>
                        <div class="pc-modal-title">@_detailProject.Title</div>
                        <div class="pc-modal-meta">
                            <span class="pc-tag pc-tag--type">@_detailProject.ProjectType</span>
                            <span class="pc-status @StatusToneClass(_detailProject.Status)">
                                <span class="pc-status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                                @StatusLabel(_detailProject.Status)
                            </span>
                            @if (_detailProject.IsAssigned)
                            {
                                <span class="pc-tag pc-tag--assigned">מוקצה</span>
                            }
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <button type="button" class="pc-modal-close" @onclick="CloseDetail" title="סגירה" aria-label="סגירה">
                    <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                         stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12" />
                    </svg>
                </button>
            </div>

            <div class="pc-modal-body">
                <div class="pc-form-section">
                    <div class="pc-form-section-title">פרטי הפרויקט</div>
                    <dl class="pc-detail-grid">
                        <div class="pc-detail-row">
                            <dt class="pc-detail-key">סוג פרויקט</dt>
                            <dd class="pc-detail-val">@_detailProject.ProjectType</dd>
                        </div>
                        <div class="pc-detail-row">
                            <dt class="pc-detail-key">מחזור אקדמי</dt>
                            <dd class="pc-detail-val">@Dash(_detailProject.AcademicYear)</dd>
                        </div>
                        <div class="pc-detail-row">
                            <dt class="pc-detail-key">עדיפות</dt>
                            <dd class="pc-detail-val">@Dash(PriorityLabel(_detailProject.Priority))</dd>
                        </div>
                        <div class="pc-detail-row">
                            <dt class="pc-detail-key">מקור</dt>
                            <dd class="pc-detail-val">
                                <span class="pc-tag @SourceToneClass(_detailProject.SourceType)">@SourceLabel(_detailProject.SourceType)</span>
                                @if (_detailProject.SourceType == "Airtable" && !string.IsNullOrEmpty(_detailProject.AirtableRecordId))
                                {
                                    <span class="pc-detail-sub" dir="ltr">@_detailProject.AirtableRecordId</span>
                                }
                            </dd>
                        </div>
                        <div class="pc-detail-row">
                            <dt class="pc-detail-key">נוצר</dt>
                            <dd class="pc-detail-val">@_detailProject.CreatedAt.ToString("dd/MM/yyyy")</dd>
                        </div>
                        @if (_detailProject.UpdatedAt.HasValue)
                        {
                            <div class="pc-detail-row">
                                <dt class="pc-detail-key">עודכן</dt>
                                <dd class="pc-detail-val">@_detailProject.UpdatedAt.Value.ToString("dd/MM/yyyy")</dd>
                            </div>
                        }
                    </dl>
                </div>

                <div class="pc-form-section">
                    <div class="pc-form-section-title">שיוך לצוות</div>
                    @if (_detailProject.IsAssigned)
                    {
                        <p class="pc-detail-text">
                            @AssignedToDisplay(_detailProject.AssignedFirstMemberName, _detailProject.AssignedTeamSize)
                            <span class="pc-detail-sub">· @_detailProject.AssignedTeamSize חברי צוות</span>
                        </p>
                    }
                    else
                    {
                        <p class="pc-detail-text pc-detail-text--quiet">הפרויקט לא שויך עדיין לצוות.</p>
                    }
                </div>

                @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(_detailProject.Description))
                {
                    <div class="pc-form-section">
                        <div class="pc-form-section-title">תיאור / צורך</div>
                        <p class="pc-detail-text">@_detailProject.Description</p>
                    </div>
                }

                @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(_detailProject.Goals))
                {
                    <div class="pc-form-section">
                        <div class="pc-form-section-title">מטרות הפרויקט</div>
                        <p class="pc-detail-text">@_detailProject.Goals</p>
                    </div>
                }

                @{
                    var hasOrgData = !string.IsNullOrEmpty(_detailProject.OrganizationName)
                                  || !string.IsNullOrEmpty(_detailProject.ContactPerson)
                                  || !string.IsNullOrEmpty(_detailProject.ContactRole)
                                  || !string.IsNullOrEmpty(_detailProject.TargetAudience);
                }
                @if (hasOrgData)
                {
                    <div class="pc-form-section">
                        <div class="pc-form-section-title">ארגון ויצירת קשר</div>
                        <dl class="pc-detail-grid">
                            @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(_detailProject.OrganizationName))
                            {
                                <div class="pc-detail-row">
                                    <dt class="pc-detail-key">ארגון</dt>
                                    <dd class="pc-detail-val">@_detailProject.OrganizationName</dd>
                                </div>
                            }
                            @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(_detailProject.ContactPerson))
                            {
                                <div class="pc-detail-row">
                                    <dt class="pc-detail-key">איש קשר</dt>
                                    <dd class="pc-detail-val">@_detailProject.ContactPerson</dd>
                                </div>
                            }
                            @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(_detailProject.ContactRole))
                            {
                                <div class="pc-detail-row">
                                    <dt class="pc-detail-key">תפקיד</dt>
                                    <dd class="pc-detail-val">@_detailProject.ContactRole</dd>
                                </div>
                            }
                            @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(_detailProject.TargetAudience))
                            {
                                <div class="pc-detail-row">
                                    <dt class="pc-detail-key">קהל יעד</dt>
                                    <dd class="pc-detail-val">@_detailProject.TargetAudience</dd>
                                </div>
                            }
                        </dl>
                    </div>
                }

                @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(_detailProject.InternalNotes))
                {
                    <div class="pc-form-section">
                        <div class="pc-form-section-title">הערות פנימיות</div>
                        <p class="pc-detail-text">@_detailProject.InternalNotes</p>
                    </div>
                }
            </div>

            <div class="pc-modal-footer">
                <button type="button" class="pc-btn-ghost" @onclick="CloseDetail">סגירה</button>
                @* Editing an ASSIGNED project stays blocked, exactly as before. *@
                @if (!_detailProject.IsAssigned)
                {
                    <button type="button" class="pc-btn-primary motiva-cta" @onclick="OpenEditFromDetail">עריכת פרויקט</button>
                }
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
}

@* ══════════════════════════════════════════
     IMPORT WIZARD
     Rendered unconditionally; MModal itself is the IsOpen gate. Placed with
     the other overlays rather than inside .pc-page so a click inside it never
     reaches the page's CloseAllMenus handler.
     ══════════════════════════════════════════ *@
<ProjectImportWizard IsOpen="_importOpen"
                     ExistingProjects="_allProjects"
                     ProjectTypes="_projectTypes"
                     AcademicYears="_academicYears"
                     OnClose="CloseImport"
                     OnImported="ReloadAsync" />

@{
    // Materialized ONCE per render: the toolbar count, the pager, the empty
    // state and the rows all read the same list, and recomputing the filter
    // per reader would let them disagree mid-render.
    var matching = SortedProjects.ToList();
    var page     = Paged(matching);

    // ONE SORTABLE <th>, DECLARED AS MARKUP.
    //
    // A templated delegate rather than a RenderFragment built with
    // RenderTreeBuilder: scoped-CSS attributes are stamped onto element markup
    // by the Razor compiler, so a <th>/<button> emitted from builder calls in
    // @code would carry no b-* attribute and NONE of the .pc-sort rules in this
    // page's stylesheet would ever match it. Written here, in the markup
    // section, it is compiled like any other element and is styled.
    RenderFragment<SortColumn> SortHeader = col =>
        @<th scope="col" aria-sort="@AriaSort(col.Key)">
            <button type="button"
                    class="pc-sort @(_sortKey == col.Key ? "pc-sort--on" : "")"
                    title="@($"מיון לפי {col.Title ?? col.Label}")"
                    @onclick="@(() => ToggleSort(col.Key))"
                    @onclick:stopPropagation="true">
                <span>@col.Label</span>
                <span class="pc-sort-mark @(_sortKey == col.Key && _sortDesc ? "pc-sort-mark--desc" : "")"
                      aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                         stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6" />
                    </svg>
                </span>
            </button>
        </th>;
}

<div class="pc-page" dir="rtl" @onclick="CloseAllMenus">

    @* ══ Header — identity, then the page-level actions ═══════════════════ *@
    <header class="pc-head">
        <div class="pc-head-main">
            <MAdminBack />

            <div class="pc-head-title">
                <h1 class="pc-h1">קטלוג פרויקטים</h1>
                <MInfoTip Text="הצעות פרויקט, זמינות ושיוך לצוותים לפי מחזור אקדמי" />
                @* Page-level metadata: one container, a hairline between the
                   two facts. It used to be plain text with a middle dot, which
                   read as a second subtitle beside the h1. *@
                @if (!_loading && !_loadError)
                {
                    <MSummaryTag Metrics="SummaryMetrics" />
                }
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pc-head-actions" @onclick:stopPropagation="true">
            @* THE AIRTABLE ROUTE IS UNCHANGED. It must NEVER hit the import
               endpoint directly — every UI path that triggers an Airtable
               import goes through preview→confirm. This navigates to that
               surface with the flag that auto-opens the preview for the
               active integration; the admin reviews counts, confirms, and
               only then is the DB written. *@
            <button type="button" class="pc-btn-secondary"
                    @onclick='() => Nav.NavigateTo("management/integrations/airtable?triggerPreviewForActive=1")'
                    title="ייבוא פרויקטים מ-Airtable עם תצוגה מקדימה ואישור">
                <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                     stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M12 3v12" />
                    <path d="m7 10 5 5 5-5" />
                    <path d="M20 17.6A5 5 0 0 0 17.5 8h-1.3A8 8 0 1 0 4 15.9" />
                </svg>
                סנכרון מ-Airtable
            </button>

            @* The file import — the second alternative, opened in place so the
               admin never leaves the table. *@
            <button type="button" class="pc-btn-secondary" @onclick="OpenImport">
                <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                     stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4" />
                    <path d="m7 10 5 5 5-5" />
                    <path d="M12 15V3" />
                </svg>
                ייבוא פרויקטים
            </button>

            @* The one primary on the page — gradient, per the shared
               .motiva-cta treatment. Geometry only lives in the stylesheet. *@
            <button type="button" class="pc-btn-primary pc-btn-primary--lg motiva-cta" @onclick="OpenAddForm">
                <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                     stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" />
                </svg>
                הוספת פרויקט
            </button>
        </div>
    </header>

    @* ══ Toolbar — one search, five filters, a conditional clear, a count ══ *@
    <div class="pc-toolbar" @onclick:stopPropagation="true">

        @* Value MUST carry the @ — MSearchField.Value is a string parameter, so
           an unprefixed `Value="_searchQuery"` is a literal and the field
           renders the field NAME as its content. *@
        <MSearchField Value="@_searchQuery"
                      ValueChanged="OnSearchChanged"
                      Placeholder="חיפוש לפי שם, ארגון או מספר פרויקט"
                      AriaLabel="חיפוש בקטלוג הפרויקטים"
                      Class="pc-search" />

        @foreach (var f in BuildFilters())
        {
            var key  = f.Key;
            var open = _openFilter == key;

            <div class="pc-filter">
                <button type="button"
                        class="pc-filter-btn @(f.IsActive ? "pc-filter-btn--on" : "")"
                        @onclick="@(() => ToggleFilter(key))"
                        aria-haspopup="listbox" aria-expanded="@(open ? "true" : "false")">
                    <span class="pc-filter-name">@f.Name</span>
                    <span class="pc-filter-value">@f.CurrentLabel</span>
                    <svg class="pc-filter-chev @(open ? "pc-filter-chev--open" : "")"
                         width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                         stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6" />
                    </svg>
                </button>

                @if (open)
                {
                    <div class="pc-menu pc-menu--filter" role="listbox" aria-label="@f.Name">
                        @foreach (var o in f.Options)
                        {
                            var val      = o.Value;
                            var selected = o.Value == f.CurrentValue;
                            <button type="button"
                                    class="pc-menu-item @(selected ? "pc-menu-item--on" : "")"
                                    role="option" aria-selected="@(selected ? "true" : "false")"
                                    @onclick="@(() => PickFilter(key, val))">
                                <span class="pc-menu-item-label">@o.Label</span>
                                @if (selected)
                                {
                                    <svg class="pc-menu-check" width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
                                         stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"
                                         stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                                        <path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7" />
                                    </svg>
                                }
                            </button>
                        }
                    </div>
                }
            </div>
        }

        @if (HasActiveFilters)
        {
            <button type="button" class="pc-clear" @onclick="ClearFilters">ניקוי סינון</button>
        }

        @if (!_loading && !_loadError)
        {
            <span class="pc-result">@ResultLine(matching.Count)</span>
        }
    </div>

    @* ══ The table ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ *@
    <MDataTable TItem="CatalogProjectListDto"
                Items="page"
                Loading="_loading"
                LoadingText="טוען קטלוג…"
                ColumnCount="7"
                MinWidth="1020px"
                Class="pc-table">

        <Columns>
            @* The title column carries no width on purpose: under
               table-layout:fixed the six sized columns are honoured exactly
               and the title takes whatever is left, so the table widens into
               the Management canvas instead of capping itself.

               THE KEBAB IS INSIDE THE NAME CELL, NOT A COLUMN OF ITS OWN.
               It used to close the row, which on a canvas-wide table put it
               the better part of a metre from the name it acts on. Giving it
               its own column one place earlier did not fix that: the name
               column is the flexible one, its text is start-aligned, and a
               short name like "3 - HIT" therefore left ~700px of empty cell
               between the title and the control that acts on it.

               As the name cell's own trailing child it simply follows the
               title — tight after a short one, after the ellipsis of a long
               one. The table is otherwise untouched: same <table>, same fixed
               layout, same MDataTable, same menu, same handlers. One column
               fewer, and the 48px it held goes to the name. *@
            <col class="pc-col-number" />
            <col />
            <col class="pc-col-type" />
            <col class="pc-col-cycle" />
            <col class="pc-col-source" />
            <col class="pc-col-status" />
            <col class="pc-col-team" />
        </Columns>

        <HeaderContent>
            @SortHeader(new SortColumn(SortKey.Number, "#", "מספר פרויקט"))
            @SortHeader(new SortColumn(SortKey.Title, "שם הפרויקט"))
            @SortHeader(new SortColumn(SortKey.Type, "סוג"))
            @SortHeader(new SortColumn(SortKey.Cycle, "מחזור"))
            @* Source and the kebab are not sortable: two values and no values
               respectively. A control that reorders nothing is noise. *@
            <th scope="col">מקור</th>
            @SortHeader(new SortColumn(SortKey.Status, "זמינות"))
            @SortHeader(new SortColumn(SortKey.Assignment, "שיוך"))
        </HeaderContent>

        <EmptyContent>
            @if (_loadError)
            {
                @* THE ERROR STATE. MDataTable has no error slot — it switches
                   on loading/empty/rows — so the failure is told here, where
                   the empty state would otherwise claim the catalog is empty.
                   It offers the retry rather than asking for a page refresh. *@
                <MEmptyState Title="לא ניתן לטעון את הקטלוג"
                             Description="הבקשה לשרת נכשלה. אפשר לנסות שוב."
                             Live="true">
                    <Action>
                        <button type="button" class="pc-btn-secondary" @onclick="ReloadAsync">
                            נסו שוב
                        </button>
                    </Action>
                </MEmptyState>
            }
            else if (_allProjects.Count == 0)
            {
                <MEmptyState Title="אין פרויקטים בקטלוג"
                             Description="ניתן להוסיף פרויקט ידנית, לייבא קובץ או לסנכרן מ-Airtable"
                             Live="true" />
            }
            else
            {
                <MEmptyState Title="לא נמצאו פרויקטים"
                             Description="נסו לשנות את החיפוש או הסינון"
                             Live="true" />
            }
        </EmptyContent>

        <RowTemplate Context="proj">
            @{
                var menuOpen = _openRowMenuId == proj.Id;
            }
            <tr class="@(menuOpen ? "m-dt-row-active" : "")">

                @* The number is the catalog's identity — the place the users
                   table puts its initials disc. Tabular and LTR-isolated so a
                   column of them aligns inside the RTL row. *@
                <td>
                    <span class="pc-num">@proj.ProjectNumber</span>
                </td>

                <td class="pc-cell-identity">
                    @* The whole title is the affordance: it opens the detail,
                       which is what a row click did before. The kebab keeps
                       every other action. *@
                    <button type="button" class="pc-title-btn"
                            title="@proj.Title"
                            @onclick="@(() => OpenDetail(proj.Id))"
                            @onclick:stopPropagation="true">
                        <span class="pc-title">@proj.Title</span>
                        @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(proj.OrganizationName))
                        {
                            <span class="pc-org">@proj.OrganizationName</span>
                        }
                    </button>

                    @* Trailing child of the identity cell, so it follows the
                       title instead of sitting a column away from it. *@
                    <div class="pc-cell-actions" @onclick:stopPropagation="true">
                        <div class="pc-actions">
                            <button type="button"
                                    class="pc-kebab @(menuOpen ? "pc-kebab--on" : "")"
                                    @onclick="@(() => ToggleRowMenu(proj.Id))"
                                    aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="@(menuOpen ? "true" : "false")"
                                    title="פעולות" aria-label="@($"פעולות עבור {proj.Title}")">
                                <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                                    <circle cx="12" cy="5" r="1.7" />
                                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.7" />
                                    <circle cx="12" cy="19" r="1.7" />
                                </svg>
                            </button>

                            @if (menuOpen)
                            {
                                <div class="pc-menu pc-menu--row" role="menu">
                                    <button type="button" class="pc-menu-item" role="menuitem"
                                            @onclick="@(() => OpenDetail(proj.Id))">
                                        <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                             stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                                            <path d="M2 12s3.6-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3.6 7-10 7-10-7-10-7Z" />
                                            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3" />
                                        </svg>
                                        צפייה בפרטים
                                    </button>

                                    @* EDIT AND AVAILABILITY STAY GATED ON ASSIGNMENT.
                                       An assigned project is owned by its team's
                                       workspace, and that rule predates this
                                       redesign — the items are absent rather than
                                       drawn as actions that will be refused. *@
                                    @if (!proj.IsAssigned)
                                    {
                                        <button type="button" class="pc-menu-item" role="menuitem"
                                                @onclick="@(() => OpenEditFormFromList(proj))">
                                            <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                                 stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                                                <path d="M17 3a2.8 2.8 0 1 1 4 4L7.5 20.5 2 22l1.5-5.5Z" />
                                            </svg>
                                            עריכת פרויקט
                                        </button>

                                        <button type="button" class="pc-menu-item" role="menuitem"
                                                @onclick="@(() => ToggleAvailability(proj))">
                                            <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                                 stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                                                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" />
                                                @if (proj.Status == "Available")
                                                {
                                                    <path d="M5.6 5.6 18.4 18.4" />
                                                }
                                                else
                                                {
                                                    <path d="m8.5 12.2 2.4 2.4 4.6-4.9" />
                                                }
                                            </svg>
                                            @(proj.Status == "Available" ? "הגדרה כלא זמין" : "הגדרה כזמין")
                                        </button>
                                    }
                                </div>
                            }
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </td>

                <td>
                    <span class="pc-tag pc-tag--type">@Dash(proj.ProjectType)</span>
                </td>

                <td class="pc-cell-quiet">@Dash(proj.AcademicYear)</td>

                <td>
                    <span class="pc-tag @SourceToneClass(proj.SourceType)">@SourceLabel(proj.SourceType)</span>
                </td>

                <td>
                    @* Dot + text, not a filled pill: the same reason the users
                       table gives — a column of filled chips would out-shout
                       the titles. The priority rides alongside it because it
                       qualifies the availability and has no column of its own. *@
                    <div class="pc-status-cell">
                        <span class="pc-status @StatusToneClass(proj.Status)">
                            <span class="pc-status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                            @StatusLabel(proj.Status)
                        </span>
                        @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(proj.Priority))
                        {
                            <span class="pc-priority pc-priority--@proj.Priority.ToLowerInvariant()">@PriorityLabel(proj.Priority)</span>
                        }
                    </div>
                </td>

                <td class="pc-cell-quiet">
                    @if (proj.IsAssigned)
                    {
                        <span class="pc-team" title="@AssignedToDisplay(proj.AssignedFirstMemberName, proj.AssignedTeamSize)">
                            @AssignedToDisplay(proj.AssignedFirstMemberName, proj.AssignedTeamSize)
                        </span>
                    }
                    else
                    {
                        <span class="pc-team pc-team--none">לא מוקצה</span>
                    }
                </td>

            </tr>
        </RowTemplate>
    </MDataTable>

    @* ══ Pager ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
         Client-side over the one unpaged GET — GET api/catalog returns the
         whole catalog and has no paging contract to change. Hidden entirely
         at one page, because a pager that cannot move is furniture. *@
    @if (!_loading && !_loadError && matching.Count > PageSize)
    {
        var totalPages = TotalPages(matching.Count);
        var current    = CurrentPage(matching.Count);
        var first      = current * PageSize + 1;
        var last       = Math.Min(first + PageSize - 1, matching.Count);

        <nav class="pc-pager" aria-label="ניווט בין עמודי הקטלוג" @onclick:stopPropagation="true">
            <span class="pc-pager-range">מציג @first–@last מתוך @matching.Count</span>

            <div class="pc-pager-controls">
                @* THE GLYPHS ARE THE RTL ONES, ON PURPOSE.
                   The RTL flow reverses the ORDER of the controls — "previous"
                   lands at the reading start, on the physical right — but it
                   does not mirror the glyphs inside them. So "previous" is a
                   chevron pointing RIGHT and "next" points LEFT, the same way
                   round every other back control in this app is drawn. This
                   page is hard dir="rtl", exactly as the users screen is, so
                   there is no LTR case for these two to also serve. *@
                <button type="button" class="pc-pager-btn"
                        disabled="@(current == 0)"
                        @onclick="@(() => GoToPage(current - 1))"
                        aria-label="לעמוד הקודם">
                    <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                         stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6" />
                    </svg>
                </button>

                @foreach (var slot in PageSlots(totalPages, current))
                {
                    if (slot < 0)
                    {
                        <span class="pc-pager-gap" aria-hidden="true">…</span>
                    }
                    else
                    {
                        var target = slot;
                        <button type="button"
                                class="pc-pager-num @(target == current ? "pc-pager-num--on" : "")"
                                aria-current="@(target == current ? "page" : null)"
                                @onclick="@(() => GoToPage(target))">
                            @(target + 1)
                        </button>
                    }
                }

                <button type="button" class="pc-pager-btn"
                        disabled="@(current >= totalPages - 1)"
                        @onclick="@(() => GoToPage(current + 1))"
                        aria-label="לעמוד הבא">
                    <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                         stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6" />
                    </svg>
                </button>
            </div>
        </nav>
    }
</div>

@code {

    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    //  Data — the same three loads as before
    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    private List<CatalogProjectListDto> _allProjects   = new();
    private List<ProjectTypeOptionDto>  _projectTypes  = new();
    private List<AcademicYearDto>       _academicYears = new();
    private bool _loading   = true;
    private bool _loadError = false;

    protected override async Task OnInitializedAsync()
    {
        await Task.WhenAll(LoadCatalogAsync(), LoadFormDataAsync());
        _loading = false;

        // ?project={id} — opens that project's detail on arrival. The
        // assignment flow's project quick view offers "לפרטי הפרויקט המלאים",
        // and a CTA promising full details has to land ON them rather than on
        // a list of 117 rows for the reader to search. Same shape as
        // /assignments?team={id}.
        if (int.TryParse(QueryValue("project"), out var projectId) && projectId > 0)
            await OpenDetail(projectId);
    }

    /// <summary>One key out of the current URL's query string. Hand-rolled for
    /// the same reason /assignments does it: one optional key does not justify
    /// a dependency this project does not otherwise take.</summary>
    private string? QueryValue(string key)
    {
        var query = Nav.ToAbsoluteUri(Nav.Uri).Query;

        foreach (var pair in query.TrimStart('?').Split('&', StringSplitOptions.RemoveEmptyEntries))
        {
            var eq = pair.IndexOf('=');
            if (eq <= 0) continue;
            if (!string.Equals(Uri.UnescapeDataString(pair[..eq]), key, StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase)) continue;
            return Uri.UnescapeDataString(pair[(eq + 1)..]);
        }
        return null;
    }

    private async Task LoadCatalogAsync()
    {
        var list     = await CatalogService.GetCatalogAsync();
        _loadError   = list is null;
        _allProjects = list ?? new List<CatalogProjectListDto>();
    }

    private async Task LoadFormDataAsync()
    {
        _projectTypes  = await CatalogService.GetProjectTypesAsync();
        _academicYears = await CatalogService.GetAcademicYearsAsync() ?? new();
    }

    /// <summary>Re-reads the list. A refetch rather than a local patch: an
    /// import can create AND update in one pass, and the server is the only
    /// thing that knows what actually landed.</summary>
    private async Task ReloadAsync()
    {
        _loading = true;
        StateHasChanged();

        await LoadCatalogAsync();
        _loading = false;
    }

    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    //  Filter / search state
    //  Client-side over the loaded list — unchanged semantics.
    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    private string _searchQuery    = "";
    private string _filterCycle    = "";
    private string _filterType     = "";
    private string _filterStatus   = "";
    private string _filterAssigned = "";
    private string _filterSource   = "";

    private IEnumerable<CatalogProjectListDto> FilteredProjects => _allProjects
        .Where(p => string.IsNullOrEmpty(_filterCycle)  || p.AcademicYear == _filterCycle)
        .Where(p => string.IsNullOrEmpty(_filterType)   || p.ProjectType  == _filterType)
        .Where(p => string.IsNullOrEmpty(_filterStatus) || p.Status       == _filterStatus)
        .Where(p => string.IsNullOrEmpty(_filterSource) || p.SourceType   == _filterSource)
        .Where(p => _filterAssigned switch
        {
            "assigned"   =>  p.IsAssigned,
            "unassigned" => !p.IsAssigned,
            _            => true,
        })
        .Where(p =>
        {
            if (string.IsNullOrEmpty(_searchQuery)) return true;
            return p.Title.Contains(_searchQuery, StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase)
                || (p.OrganizationName ?? "").Contains(_searchQuery, StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase)
                || p.ProjectNumber.ToString().Contains(_searchQuery);
        });

    private void OnSearchChanged(string value)
    {
        _searchQuery = value;
        _pageIndex   = 0;
        CloseAllMenus();
    }

    // ── The toolbar's five filters ───────────────────────────────────────
    //
    // Every option list is DERIVED from the loaded catalog rather than stated
    // literally. That matters most for status: the old page offered exactly
    // זמין / לא זמין, but Projects.Status also holds values the assignment
    // flow writes ("Active", "InProgress"), and those rows were unreachable
    // through the filter. Assignment is the one exception — IsAssigned is a
    // bool, so its two options ARE the domain.
    private sealed record FilterOption(string Value, string Label);

    private sealed record FilterDef(string Key, string Name, string CurrentValue,
                                    string CurrentLabel, bool IsActive,
                                    IReadOnlyList<FilterOption> Options);

    private const string AllValue = "";
    private const string AllLabel = "הכל";

    private IEnumerable<FilterDef> BuildFilters()
    {
        yield return MakeFilter("cycle",  "מחזור",  _filterCycle,  CycleOptions());
        yield return MakeFilter("type",   "סוג",    _filterType,   TypeOptions());
        yield return MakeFilter("status", "זמינות", _filterStatus, StatusOptions());
        yield return MakeFilter("assigned", "שיוך", _filterAssigned, new[]
        {
            new FilterOption("unassigned", "לא מוקצה"),
            new FilterOption("assigned",   "מוקצה"),
        });
        yield return MakeFilter("source", "מקור", _filterSource, SourceOptions());
    }

    private static FilterDef MakeFilter(string key, string name, string current,
                                        IEnumerable<FilterOption> options)
    {
        var all  = new[] { new FilterOption(AllValue, AllLabel) }.Concat(options).ToList();
        var here = all.FirstOrDefault(o => o.Value == current);

        return new FilterDef(
            Key:          key,
            Name:         name,
            // A value that is no longer represented in the data still has to
            // render as itself rather than silently reading as "הכל".
            CurrentValue: current,
            CurrentLabel: here?.Label ?? current,
            IsActive:     !string.IsNullOrEmpty(current),
            Options:      all);
    }

    private IEnumerable<FilterOption> CycleOptions() =>
        _allProjects
            .Select(p => p.AcademicYear)
            .Where(y => !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(y))
            .Distinct()
            .OrderByDescending(y => y, StringComparer.Ordinal)
            .Select(y => new FilterOption(y, y));

    private IEnumerable<FilterOption> TypeOptions() =>
        _allProjects
            .Select(p => p.ProjectType)
            .Where(t => !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(t))
            .Distinct()
            .OrderBy(t => t, StringComparer.Ordinal)
            .Select(t => new FilterOption(t, t));

    private IEnumerable<FilterOption> StatusOptions() =>
        _allProjects
            .Select(p => p.Status)
            .Where(s => !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(s))
            .Distinct()
            // The catalog's own two values lead; anything the assignment flow
            // wrote follows, so the common case stays at the top of the menu.
            .OrderBy(s => s switch { "Available" => 0, "Unavailable" => 1, _ => 2 })
            .ThenBy(s => s, StringComparer.Ordinal)
            .Select(s => new FilterOption(s, StatusLabel(s)));

    private IEnumerable<FilterOption> SourceOptions() =>
        _allProjects
            .Select(p => p.SourceType)
            .Where(s => !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(s))
            .Distinct()
            .OrderBy(s => s, StringComparer.Ordinal)
            .Select(s => new FilterOption(s, SourceLabel(s)));

    private bool HasActiveFilters =>
        !string.IsNullOrEmpty(_searchQuery)
        || !string.IsNullOrEmpty(_filterCycle)
        || !string.IsNullOrEmpty(_filterType)
        || !string.IsNullOrEmpty(_filterStatus)
        || !string.IsNullOrEmpty(_filterAssigned)
        || !string.IsNullOrEmpty(_filterSource);

    private void ClearFilters()
    {
        _searchQuery    = "";
        _filterCycle    = "";
        _filterType     = "";
        _filterStatus   = "";
        _filterAssigned = "";
        _filterSource   = "";
        _pageIndex      = 0;
        CloseAllMenus();
    }

    private void PickFilter(string key, string value)
    {
        switch (key)
        {
            case "cycle":    _filterCycle    = value; break;
            case "type":     _filterType     = value; break;
            case "status":   _filterStatus   = value; break;
            case "assigned": _filterAssigned = value; break;
            case "source":   _filterSource   = value; break;
        }
        _openFilter = null;
        _pageIndex  = 0;
    }

    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    //  Sorting — client-side, over the same loaded list
    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    private enum SortKey { Number, Title, Type, Cycle, Status, Assignment }

    // The server's own ORDER BY is AcademicYearId DESC, ProjectNumber. With one
    // cycle in the data that is the project number ascending, so the default
    // here reproduces the order the page has always opened in.
    private SortKey _sortKey = SortKey.Number;
    private bool    _sortDesc;

    private void ToggleSort(SortKey key)
    {
        // Same column: flip. Different column: adopt it ascending, because a
        // sort that arrives already reversed reads as a bug.
        if (_sortKey == key) _sortDesc = !_sortDesc;
        else { _sortKey = key; _sortDesc = false; }

        _pageIndex = 0;
        CloseAllMenus();
    }

    private IEnumerable<CatalogProjectListDto> SortedProjects
    {
        get
        {
            var rows = FilteredProjects;

            // ProjectNumber is the tiebreaker on every key: it is unique, so
            // two renders of the same filtered set can never disagree about
            // the order of equal rows.
            IOrderedEnumerable<CatalogProjectListDto> ordered = _sortKey switch
            {
                SortKey.Title  => Direction(rows, p => p.Title),
                SortKey.Type   => Direction(rows, p => p.ProjectType),
                SortKey.Cycle  => Direction(rows, p => p.AcademicYear),
                SortKey.Status => Direction(rows, p => StatusLabel(p.Status)),
                // An unassigned project is the one that needs attention, so
                // "ascending" puts those first and the staffed ones after.
                SortKey.Assignment => Direction(rows, p => p.IsAssigned ? 1 : 0),
                _ => _sortDesc
                    ? rows.OrderByDescending(p => p.ProjectNumber)
                    : rows.OrderBy(p => p.ProjectNumber),
            };

            return ordered.ThenBy(p => p.ProjectNumber);
        }
    }

    private IOrderedEnumerable<CatalogProjectListDto> Direction<TKey>(
        IEnumerable<CatalogProjectListDto> rows,
        Func<CatalogProjectListDto, TKey> selector) =>
        _sortDesc ? rows.OrderByDescending(selector) : rows.OrderBy(selector);

    /// <summary>One column the head offers a sort control for. `Title` is the
    /// tooltip when the visible label is not a sentence — the "#" column.</summary>
    private sealed record SortColumn(SortKey Key, string Label, string? Title = null);

    /// <summary>aria-sort is what makes the current order audible; without it
    /// the chevron is a purely visual claim.</summary>
    private string AriaSort(SortKey key) =>
        _sortKey != key ? "none" : _sortDesc ? "descending" : "ascending";

    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    //  Paging — client-side, over the one unpaged GET
    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    private const int PageSize = 25;

    /// <summary>The page the admin ASKED for. What is actually drawn is
    /// <see cref="CurrentPage"/>, which clamps it against the set in hand:
    /// every render reads the clamped value, so a set that shrinks under the
    /// stored index (a filter, a status flip, a reload that returns fewer
    /// rows) shows the last real page instead of an empty one — and it does so
    /// without writing state during a render.</summary>
    private int _pageIndex;

    private static int TotalPages(int count) => Math.Max(1, (int)Math.Ceiling(count / (double)PageSize));

    private int CurrentPage(int count) => Math.Clamp(_pageIndex, 0, TotalPages(count) - 1);

    private List<CatalogProjectListDto> Paged(List<CatalogProjectListDto> rows) =>
        rows.Skip(CurrentPage(rows.Count) * PageSize).Take(PageSize).ToList();

    private void GoToPage(int index)
    {
        _pageIndex = index;
        CloseAllMenus();
    }

    /// <summary>The page numbers to draw: always the first, the last and the
    /// current one's neighbours, with -1 standing for an elided run. A pager
    /// that lists all five pages of a 117-row catalog is fine; one that lists
    /// forty is not, and this screen has to survive both.</summary>
    private IEnumerable<int> PageSlots(int totalPages, int current)
    {
        const int Window = 1;
        var last = totalPages - 1;
        var prev = -2;

        for (var i = 0; i <= last; i++)
        {
            var keep = i == 0 || i == last || Math.Abs(i - current) <= Window;
            if (!keep) continue;

            if (prev >= 0 && i - prev > 1) yield return -1;
            yield return i;
            prev = i;
        }
    }

